 "id": "c_mi_076",
 "prompt": "In a grand medieval banquet hall, a long oak table stretches beneath towering stone pillars, flanked by wooden benches and stools. Golden goblets clink beside pewter plates, each set before servings of roasted turkey, crusty loaves of bread, and wheels of cheese garnished with clusters of grapes. Tall candlesticks cast flickering light over embroidered tapestries and stained glass windows depicting ancient battles. At the head of the table sits a gilded throne beneath a heraldic banner, while a suit of armor stands guard near a roaring fireplace. A minstrel plucks a lute beside a squire who pours mead from a drinking horn into a silver flagon. Nearby, a freshly baked pie cools in a wooden bowl, and a torch sconce glows along the flagstone walls. The floorboards creak beneath heavy boots on the wooden floor. There is no electric lamp, no plastic chair, no modern painting, no microphone, and no clock.",
